{
  "_note": "分组标题行(page-design-system.md §2:**左名字 + 右摘要**,13pt/sub)。四个分组共用一个模板,标题与右摘要的量词都按入参 `k` 用 op:if 从本模板的 i18n 表里取 —— 不走 params 传文案(params 里的字面串没有 locale 维度,G8),也不为四个分组各开一个文件(版式会各自漂)。\n⚠️ 右摘要那一格不是装饰,是**这一段的答案**:有几条。数字由 XPage 传 `v`(纯数字无 locale 维度),量词留在本表里。`widget` 那一档没有可给的答案,故不渲右格。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${k},inc),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "4pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-120pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.inc}",
            "fontSize": "13pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "{parent.w}-118pt",
            "y": "4pt",
            "w": "118pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "alignmentH": "2",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${v},0)]${@i18n.u_inc}",
            "fontSize": "13pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${k},maint),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "4pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-120pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.maint}",
            "fontSize": "13pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "{parent.w}-118pt",
            "y": "4pt",
            "w": "118pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "alignmentH": "2",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${v},0)]${@i18n.u_maint}",
            "fontSize": "13pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${k},widget),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "4pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-120pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.widget}",
            "fontSize": "13pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${k},zone),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "0pt",
            "y": "4pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-120pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "text": "${@i18n.zone}",
            "fontSize": "13pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          },
          {
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "{parent.w}-118pt",
            "y": "4pt",
            "w": "118pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "alignmentH": "2",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${v},0)]${@i18n.u_zone}",
            "fontSize": "13pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "maxLines": "1"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "inc": "进行中事件",
        "maint": "计划维护",
        "widget": "可添加到桌面",
        "zone": "我的域名",
        "u_inc": " 个",
        "u_maint": " 项",
        "u_zone": " 个"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "inc": "Open incidents",
        "maint": "Planned maintenance",
        "widget": "Add to home screen",
        "zone": "My zones",
        "u_inc": "",
        "u_maint": "",
        "u_zone": ""
      }
    },
    "i18nEmptyOk": [
      "u_inc",
      "u_maint",
      "u_zone"
    ],
    "_i18nEmptyNote": "英文档量词就是**没有**:「Open incidents  2」本来就读得通,而「2 items」是硬凑。空串是刻意的。"
  }
}
